<H2 style="FONT-SIZE: 20px; BORDER-BOTTOM: #57606f 1px solid; TEXT-TRANSFORM: uppercase; COLOR: #f39c12; PADDING-BOTTOM: 8px">1. DISPERSAL DIRECTIVE</H2>
<P style="FONT-SIZE: 17px">ALL SQUADRONS SHALL INITIATE <B>EMERGENCY SCRAMBLE</B>. TRANSITION TO PRE-DESIGNATED <B>HIGHWAY STRIPS (HWS)</B> AND REMOTE PROVINCIAL AIRFIELDS IMMEDIATELY. THE ENEMY SEEKS TO DESTROY US IN OUR NESTS; WE SHALL NOT BE THERE TO RECEIVE THE BLOW.</P>
<H2 style="FONT-SIZE: 20px; BORDER-BOTTOM: #57606f 1px solid; TEXT-TRANSFORM: uppercase; COLOR: #f39c12; PADDING-BOTTOM: 8px">2. RECOVERY &amp; QUICK TURNAROUND (QTA)</H2>
<UL style="FONT-SIZE: 17px; PADDING-LEFT: 25px">
<LI style="MARGIN-BOTTOM: 10px"><B>LANDING:</B> TOUCHDOWN AT ASSIGNED FARP/PROVINCIAL SITES ASAP.</LI>
<LI style="MARGIN-BOTTOM: 10px"><B>REARM/REFUEL:</B> EXECUTE <B>"QUICK TURNAROUND"</B> PROCEDURES UPON ENGINE SHUTDOWN. HOT-PIT REFUELING AUTHORIZED.</LI>
<LI style="MARGIN-BOTTOM: 10px"><B>READINESS:</B> UPON COMPLETION OF QTA, ALL AIRFRAMES SHALL MAINTAIN <B>2-MINUTE ALERT STATUS</B> (STRS).</LI></UL>
<DIV style="FONT-SIZE: 17px; BACKGROUND: #353b48; MARGIN-TOP: 25px; COLOR: #bdc3c7; PADDING-BOTTOM: 20px; FONT-STYLE: italic; PADDING-TOP: 20px; PADDING-LEFT: 20px; BORDER-LEFT: #f39c12 4px solid; PADDING-RIGHT: 20px; border-radius: 4px">"Let the iron rain fall upon empty concrete. While the adversary celebrates the destruction of our ghosts, the <B>Kokko</B> gathers its strength in the shadows of the forest. We do not flee to hide; we disperse to survive, and we survive to strike back with a fury they cannot anticipate. When they think us broken, we shall rise from the trees." </DIV>
